{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle Point is an arcade Formula-style racing game built for pure fun and speed. Forget about heavy simulators \u2014 here, the controls are simple, the cars are responsive, and every track invites you to push harder and enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three different cars and race on three tracks that bring just enough challenge to keep things exciting. The AI opponents are far from perfect \u2014 they\u2019ll make mistakes, miss turns, and open the door for you to grab the lead. This keeps the races lively and lighthearted rather than punishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle Point is all about the joy of racing: fast laps, quick overtakes, and the thrill of crossing the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arcade-style Formula racing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 cars with unique handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 tracks with varied challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- AI rivals that aren\u2019t always perfect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic races focused on fun over complexity</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000290?t=1757378732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000290?t=1757378732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000290/674485c97226c8050467de5450e5e3564a503e09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757378732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000290/674485c97226c8050467de5450e5e3564a503e09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757378732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle Point is an arcade Formula-style racing game built for pure fun and speed. Forget about